    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Resilience, critical thinking, problem-solving skills and integrity are key attributes employers look for in entry-level youth. Employers look for individuals willing to consciously take on difficult tasks at the workplace and adapt to challenges in a smart and flexible manner.",
